# Block syntax typed and finished with Enter becomes that block.
# `---` on the first line opens front matter; Down leaves a code-like block
# at the end of the document through a new paragraph.
type ---\ntitle: x
key Down
type # A\n[toc]\npara\n---\n$$\nx^2
key Down
type 3. three\nfour\n\n* star\nnext\n\n```rust\nfn main() {}
key Down
type |a|b|\n
dump @OUT@
